<title>POLAND: NBP REJECTS ALL PLN 310 MLN BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</title>
<headline>NBP REJECTS ALL PLN 310 MLN BIDS AT REVERSE REPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all 310 million zlotys worth of bids at Friday's 300 million zloty 14-day NBP-bill repurchase auction.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
